     6	def count_up_to(n):
     7	    """Implement a function that takes an non-negative integer and returns an array of the first n
     8	    integers that are prime numbers and less than n.
     9	    for example:
    10	    count_up_to(5) => [2,3]
    11	    count_up_to(11) => [2,3,5,7]
